{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Publish invocation-end fatals to the invocation signal.** This rethrows without notifying `operationFatalObserver`. If the handler returned with `stepAsync` work queued, shutdown can still start its user body and checkpoints after plugins have finalized, despite the invocation now failing and retrying. Report the fatal after all end hooks and before rethrowing, then test a queued at-least-once operation with a fatal end hook.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc75xCNN","finding_digest":"a846979ad3a789a4532f06851b9af958831c5096a588173d37f665a8f39a3fe3","finding_id":"arf_v1_vbdjpgwtu6e2iuzpa2crxgxzlc","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::fatal-signal-propagation","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::fatal-signal-propagation","line":325,"observation_digest":"29a38265da15ce84d99d84f50aa80ca0f3eb6fae4d9407d1e14a7512594abe65","observation_id":"aro_v1_fgryezo2cxhijwm5qt2qvkamud","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-06T00:45:24Z","review_id":"arr_v1_523fpro2dldye6ezvg2q6x7mrp","reviewed_base_sha":"ac6a6f5ea50d6a9098b716905f01c609e4c201ae","reviewed_head_sha":"e6a6d94fc7b34a020f2b5b8dbf1100d2be12e08b","reviewer":"codex","start_line":325,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":721},"record_id":"art_v1_ssppc6xrycah2ayluev4wyas3a","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-06T00:45:24Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
